From: TAHAI Web Services
Subject: [PATCH] Retain original SeaHash MIT license text

The 4.1.0 Cargo manifest declares MIT but omits the full license file.
Restore the original author's MIT text from the upstream parent repository:
https://api.github.com/repos/redox-os/tfs/git/blobs/3903091a13728186595aa53ee9a3765bc95fb0c7
The 4.1.0 Cargo.toml authors also credit Tom Almeida; retain that metadata.
This is license-text packaging only, not a change to the package's license.

diff --git a/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
